{"seq":4,"slug":"major-works","title":"鲁迅·代表成就","stage":"DONE","category":"lu-xun","categoryLabel":"鲁迅","chapterCount":3,"docCount":8,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/lu-xun/major-works","rating":{"composite":3.83,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":3.6,"coverage":3.25,"positioning":4.67,"strategic":4},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":null},"hubDir":"/Users/wangyang.learnwy/learnwy/learnwy/l-doc-hub/hubs/famous-people/02_lu-xun/4_major-works","introHtml":"<h1 id=\"鲁迅-代表成就\">鲁迅·代表成就</h1><p>本 hub 只回答一个问题：<strong>鲁迅究竟写了什么、为什么这些文本重要</strong>。它按文体把鲁迅的文本遗产分为三章——小说、杂文与散文、翻译与遗产——以确切的发表时间、版本与文本事实为依据，逐部作品说清它&quot;新在哪里、立住了什么标杆&quot;。这里不评生平、不谈方法论、不做盖棺论定，那些交给本系列的兄弟 hub。</p>\n<h2 id=\"本-hub-与兄弟-hub-的分工边界\">本 hub 与兄弟 hub 的分工边界</h2><p>鲁迅系列共六个 hub，彼此分工明确，避免重复：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Hub</th>\n<th>回答的问题</th>\n<th>与本 hub 的边界</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>1 生平与时代</td>\n<td>他<strong>何时何地经历了什么</strong></td>\n<td>提供作品诞生的传记语境；本 hub 只看文本本身</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>2 核心贡献</td>\n<td>他的成就在文学史上<strong>值多少分</strong></td>\n<td>做总体评价与定位；本 hub 做逐部作品的细读</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>3 思想与方法</td>\n<td>他<strong>怎么想、怎么写</strong>（方法论）</td>\n<td>抽取&quot;反抗绝望&quot;&quot;杂文作为方法&quot;等观念；本 hub 落在具体文本</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>4 代表成就（本 hub）</strong></td>\n<td>他<strong>具体写了哪些作品、各自重要在哪</strong></td>\n<td>以作品为单位的事实性梳理</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>5 影响与遗产</td>\n<td>他<strong>身后如何被传播、被继承</strong></td>\n<td>谈国内外接受史；本 hub 止于作品完成</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>6 争议与评价</td>\n<td>围绕他<strong>有哪些分歧</strong></td>\n<td>处理论战与评价争议；本 hub 不卷入褒贬</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>一句话区分：想知道&quot;《彷徨》收了哪些篇、写了什么&quot;，看本 hub；想知道&quot;鲁迅小说为何被视为现代文学奠基&quot;，看 hub 2/5；想知道&quot;他为什么这样写&quot;，看 hub 3。</p>\n<h2 id=\"推荐学习路径\">推荐学习路径</h2><p><strong>初次接触鲁迅（中学生 / 一般读者）</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li><a href=\"fiction-collections/call-to-arms\">《呐喊》：中国现代小说的开山之作</a>——从《狂人日记》《阿 Q 正传》《孔乙己》入门，这些是教材里的篇目。</li>\n<li><a href=\"essays-and-prose/wild-grass-and-morning-blossoms\">《野草》与《朝花夕拾》：鲁迅的内心世界</a>——读《从百草园到三味书屋》《藤野先生》，感受温润的一面。</li>\n<li><a href=\"translation-and-legacy/new-culture-and-influence\">新文化运动旗手与思想遗产</a>——理解他为什么重要。</li>\n</ol>\n<p><strong>想系统把握鲁迅文学全貌（文学爱好者 / 文科学生）</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li>三部小说集：<a href=\"fiction-collections/call-to-arms\">《呐喊》</a> → <a href=\"fiction-collections/wandering-and-old-tales\">《彷徨》与《故事新编》</a> → <a href=\"fiction-collections/ah-q-and-diary\">小说艺术专论</a>。</li>\n<li>散文与杂文两路：<a href=\"essays-and-prose/zawen-as-weapon\">杂文：&quot;匕首与投枪&quot;</a> 与 <a href=\"essays-and-prose/wild-grass-and-morning-blossoms\">《野草》《朝花夕拾》</a>。</li>\n<li>收尾看常被忽略的两面：<a href=\"essays-and-prose/literary-history-scholarship\">《中国小说史略》与学术成就</a>、<a href=\"translation-and-legacy/translation-and-woodcut\">翻译与木刻</a>。</li>\n</ol>\n<p><strong>研究者 / 进阶</strong>\n建议横向对读：先通读本 hub 全部 8 篇建立文本地图，再转入 <a href=\"../ideas-and-methods/critical-method/zawen-as-method\">思想与方法</a> 与 <a href=\"../controversies-and-appraisal/debates-and-polemics/revolutionary-literature-debate\">争议与评价</a>，把&quot;写了什么&quot;与&quot;怎么写、争什么&quot;打通。</p>\n<h2 id=\"前置知识\">前置知识</h2><p>阅读本 hub 几乎无门槛，但具备以下背景会更顺：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>五四与新文化运动的大致脉络</strong>——多数作品是这场运动的产物，可先看 <a href=\"../life-and-times/literary-breakthrough-and-may-fourth/call-to-arms-and-vernacular\">《狂人日记》与白话小说的开端</a>。</li>\n<li><strong>文言与白话的区别</strong>——理解《呐喊》的语言突破需要这一对照，相关语言背景见 <a href=\"../../../linguistics/sociolinguistics/language-and-society/language-power\">语言与权力</a>。</li>\n<li><strong>&quot;国民性&quot;这一概念</strong>——它是鲁迅小说与杂文反复处理的母题，专论见 <a href=\"../core-contributions/thought-enlightenment/national-character-critique\">国民性批判</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>需要说明的是，&quot;代表成就&quot;不等于&quot;全部成就&quot;，也不意味着对鲁迅的评价没有分歧。本 hub 力求先让读者看清作品本身，再去其它 hub 理解后世围绕他展开的解读与争论。</p>\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"fiction-collections","title":"小说创作的奠基","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/lu-xun/major-works/fiction-collections","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"call-to-arms","title":"《呐喊》：中国现代小说的开山之作","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/lu-xun/major-works/fiction-collections/call-to-arms"},{"seq":2,"slug":"wandering-and-old-tales","title":"《彷徨》与《故事新编》：苦闷与重述","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/lu-xun/major-works/fiction-collections/wandering-and-old-tales"},{"seq":3,"slug":"ah-q-and-diary","title":"阿 Q、狂人与鲁迅的小说艺术","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/lu-xun/major-works/fiction-collections/ah-q-and-diary"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"essays-and-prose","title":"杂文与散文的高峰","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/lu-xun/major-works/essays-and-prose","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"zawen-as-weapon","title":"杂文：作为\"匕首与投枪\"的文体","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/lu-xun/major-works/essays-and-prose/zawen-as-weapon"},{"seq":2,"slug":"wild-grass-and-morning-blossoms","title":"《野草》与《朝花夕拾》：鲁迅的内心世界","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/lu-xun/major-works/essays-and-prose/wild-grass-and-morning-blossoms"},{"seq":3,"slug":"literary-history-scholarship","title":"《中国小说史略》与鲁迅的学术成就","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/lu-xun/major-works/essays-and-prose/literary-history-scholarship"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"translation-and-legacy","title":"翻译·新文化与思想遗产","docCount":2,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/lu-xun/major-works/translation-and-legacy","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"translation-and-woodcut","title":"翻译与木刻：为新文化\"盗火\"","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/lu-xun/major-works/translation-and-legacy/translation-and-woodcut"},{"seq":2,"slug":"new-culture-and-influence","title":"新文化运动旗手与思想遗产","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/lu-xun/major-works/translation-and-legacy/new-culture-and-influence"}]}]}